Z||000023||fyerstarter||03-23-2001||09:13 PM||||If you want black plastic sail panels simply paint the inside with satin or flat black spray paint. It will look nice and glossy from the outside through the glass and if you do a good job will look just like a piece of trim from the inside. I did the sail panels on my GT when I got the windows tinted and it looks awesome. <P>They were cracked anyway so I had nothing to lose :P  But when I get the new ones I will be doing the same.||||reg||1
